.DS_Store
# Python bytecode (e.g. from importing ui-service.py in a test): never part of the chart
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The platform service's code is in its image (development/tools/build-ui-image.sh), not in the chart: Helm keeps each
# release in a Secret of at most 1 MiB. pgwire.py stays: the bootstrap Job runs it from its ConfigMap.
files/ui-updates/*
